{
  "_comment": [
    "The demo Live Activity's ContentState for a demo request row (docs/demo-island.md).",
    "Written by hand, and held on BOTH sides: server/tests/test_demo_island.py runs",
    "demo_push.content_state over every case and mobile/__tests__/demoActivity.test.ts runs",
    "src/live/demoState.ts demoState, so the card the server pushes and the card the phone draws",
    "from its own poll are one card. The request is the route's own shape (`created_at` and",
    "`claimed_at` as `isoformat()` writes them, microseconds and all); `kit_published_at` is the",
    "project's shown kit (`GET /v1/projects/{key}/kit` published_at), null or absent for none; `now`",
    "is Unix seconds; `expect: null` is a request no card shows. The phase is `demoStepFor`, the",
    "in-app island's rule, renamed, and a done request is `ready` only when `kitFromRequest` holds",
    "(a kit published at or after the Mac took it), `made` otherwise."
  ],
